<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`seat.ts` seats one composition on the verb socket: gates each line and session frame, arbitrates its id in the ask book, dispatches to the island and answers once the outcome lands. The dispatch road: the hand and seat walls, the chore face, a visit's target and the face's actor gate a call before the book's turn; past a `run` verdict nothing un-dispatches it. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/uds-channel-dam`>>) carries its observations.

<<~/ahu>>

